# The image build context. The Dockerfile COPYs only lib/, pom.xml and src/,
# so everything below is streamed to the builder for nothing.
#
# Jenkins builds from a clean clone, where most of this does not exist, which
# is why it never noticed; a KubeCoder checkout has .git, a Maven target/ and
# the pytest suite in it, and `kaniko` tars the context where it stands.

# Version control — 3.8 MiB of it, half the context on its own.
.git
.gitignore

# Build output. `mvn clean package` rebuilds it inside the image anyway.
target

# The pytest suite that drives a live Gitblit, and its Poetry lockfile.
tests
__pycache__

# Docs, CI and editor/environment config.
docs
scripts
.vscode
.kubecoder
Jenkinsfile
Jenkinsfile.architecture
README.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Onboarding scratch note, untracked.
ONBOARDING-STATE.md
